{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46782","headline":"荆门勉怀寄道林寺诸友 · 齐己","name":"荆门勉怀寄道林寺诸友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荣枯得失理昭然，谁斅离骚更问天。\n生下便知真梦幻，老来何必叹流年。\n清风不变诗应在，明月无踪道可传。\n珍重匡庐沃洲主，拂衣抛却好林泉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46782.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46782","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}